==Notes==

* Damage is also applied each [[round]] to targets in the affected area (not just upon entering the area).
*Damage from this spell is capped at 20d6. Caster levels above 20 will increase the duration of this spell, but not the damage.
*This spell is often used by caster type clerics as a finishing blow as damage is dealt with the initial cast on the target.
*A useful tactic in [[PvM]] is laying down many overlapping blade barriers, then luring monsters across them.

===Previous versions===

*Prior to version 1.69, this spell ignored [[evasion]] and [[improved evasion]].

